      "writtenOn": "2021-09-08T05:32:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No the test does need the network to be validated. It uses OEM_NETWORK_PREFERENCE_TEST, which prefers NOT_METERED\u0026VALIDATED to TEST networks, to make it as close as possible to the OEM_NETWORK_PREFERENCE_OEM_PAID setting used in production.\n\nhttps://osscs.corp.google.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Connectivity/service/src/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java;l\u003d10408?q\u003dOEM_NETWORK_PREFERENCE_TEST\n\nSee aosp/1821292 for what I think is a slightly better solution than this.",
